94139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186481754 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1075 #edb/ref 17592186481756 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1077 "I" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1078 #edb/ref 17592186481756 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481759 1079 #uuid "9525a6e4-2431-55ce-91b6-40d7a688e4cf" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1075 #edb/ref 17592186481757 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1075 #edb/ref 17592186481761 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1076 #edb/ref 17592186408166 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1077 "III" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1078 #edb/ref 17592186481761 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481760 1079 #uuid "b5ca4e79-9a78-5e09-ad2e-1b4358963f5c" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481761 1080 "false" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481761 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481761 1083 #uuid "d1da4748-78a9-5547-93fa-277269ba94ff" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1068 #edb/ref 17592186481755 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1068 #edb/ref 17592186481759 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1068 #edb/ref 17592186481760 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1071 "Which of the following improper integrals are divergent?\n- **I.** ${\\int }_{2}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-1}}\\,\\text{d}x$\n- **II.** ${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-1}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x$\n- **III.** ${\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nSelect all that apply." 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1072 #uuid "e50acc57-5eee-5203-9dd8-5e7531f41fa1" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481762 1074 "Let's work out each integral.\n\nFor the first integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{2}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{2}^{a}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[2\\sqrt{x-1}]}_{2}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(2\\sqrt{a-1}-2\\sqrt{2-1}) \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(2\\sqrt{a-1}-2) \\\\  & =\\infty ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral diverges.\n\nFor the second integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-1}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{-1}\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[\\operatorname{ln}⁡|x|]}_{a}^{-1} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|-1|-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|a|) \\\\  & =-\\infty ,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral diverges.\n\nFor the third integral, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{1}^{a}\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{[-\\frac{1}{x}]}_{1}^{a} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to \\infty }(-\\frac{1}{a}+\\frac{1}{1}) \\\\  & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nso the integral is convergent.\n\nIn conclusion, only integrals I and II are divergent." 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481763 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186083201.py" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true] [17592186481763 1169 #uuid "4153fd36-4e27-5567-b96f-e7f283d02624" 13194139535225 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"02a656c4-82b8-5e88-8816-0dc0a192bb9e" 17592186481753 "145423fa-33a3-52aa-ae1d-b24235875c7c" 17592186481754 "23c3cc50-8f49-5f0a-a0d2-109c1fb2b62f" 17592186481755 "3630167e-491c-546f-ac6e-210342635c1e" 17592186481756 "775f0f81-df07-5d86-9ff9-7f28b4ccaf9a" 17592186481757 "80096874-46a7-55a9-a918-5e3243f639ba" 17592186481758 "9525a6e4-2431-55ce-91b6-40d7a688e4cf" 17592186481759 "b5ca4e79-9a78-5e09-ad2e-1b4358963f5c" 175921864817